1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,566
Hello! Vanakkam!

2
00:00:02,816 --> 00:00:04,847
Let's learn our Silambam app together!

3
00:00:07,517 --> 00:00:08,513
Open the app.

4
00:00:08,763 --> 00:00:10,207
Tap Parent or Student.

5
00:00:11,857 --> 00:00:13,112
Type your phone number.

6
00:00:13,362 --> 00:00:15,322
Then your secret 6-number PIN.

7
00:00:15,932 --> 00:00:16,890
Tap Sign in!

8
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:21,038
You can pick English, Malay or Tamil!

9
00:00:24,428 --> 00:00:25,643
Here are your children.

10
00:00:25,893 --> 00:00:27,109
See their belt colour.

11
00:00:27,359 --> 00:00:29,074
See how many classes they came.

12
00:00:31,084 --> 00:00:32,515
Tap a name to see more.

13
00:00:33,245 --> 00:00:34,405
Green means came.

14
00:00:34,655 --> 00:00:35,875
Red means absent.

15
00:00:36,125 --> 00:00:37,354
Orange means late.

16
00:00:37,964 --> 00:00:39,477
See belt tests here too!

17
00:00:42,267 --> 00:00:43,573
Time to pay the fee?

18
00:00:43,823 --> 00:00:44,612
Tap Pay.

19
00:00:45,222 --> 00:00:47,242
You can see the Master's bank account.

20
00:00:47,972 --> 00:00:48,885
Tap Copy!

21
00:00:50,535 --> 00:00:51,538
Paid by bank?

22
00:00:51,788 --> 00:00:53,432
Take a photo of your receipt.

23
00:00:54,042 --> 00:00:55,342
Tap Send to Master.

24
00:00:57,352 --> 00:00:58,306
Now we wait.

25
00:00:58,556 --> 00:00:59,787
The Master checks it.

26
00:01:00,397 --> 00:01:01,569
Then it turns green!

27
00:01:04,479 --> 00:01:05,984
Notices tell you news.

28
00:01:06,234 --> 00:01:07,549
Like belt test day!

29
00:01:09,439 --> 00:01:10,863
Belts shows what to learn.

30
00:01:11,473 --> 00:01:13,609
Learn these, then get your next belt!

31
00:01:16,879 --> 00:01:18,468
Students can sign in too,

32
00:01:18,718 --> 00:01:19,938
with their own phone.

33
00:01:21,828 --> 00:01:22,569
All done?

34
00:01:22,819 --> 00:01:23,806
Tap Sign out.

35
00:01:25,576 --> 00:01:26,558
Great job!

36
00:01:26,808 --> 00:01:27,842
See you at class!

37
00:01:28,092 --> 00:01:28,918
Vanakkam!
